# Supabase Postgres (source of truth).
# TEMPORARY: both point at the DIRECT connection (port 5432) because the real
# pooled connection string (Session/Transaction pooler, port 6543) is not yet
# known here — see the final report for what's needed from the Supabase
# dashboard to switch DATABASE_URL to the pooler properly.
# connection_limit=1 was tried and REVERTED: it broke purchaseLead's
# interactive $transaction() under any concurrent request (P2028 "Transaction
# not found" — the single connection got reassigned mid-transaction). A small
# pool (5) with a generous pool_timeout is the safer middle ground until the
# real pooler string is available.


